%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a9d446fdaefde204fbc683b0f43e403d, type: 3}
  m_Name: D5E1_LadyChairEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequence:
  - npcDialogueText: I'm sick of this rock. Every night is a carbon copy of the last
      one. I want out, but this place...
    buttonText: It doesn't have an exit
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: We were looking for a light that never came again. She thought we were
        trapped in a loop.
      duration: 9
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: There are no ships, no horizon... just us and the Tavern. Did
      you finally get that loony to talk?
    buttonText: He did
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: I told her about the scavenger. The man who knows the secrets buried
        deep in the island.
      duration: 9
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: I knew it. I told you he was hiding something. What did he say?
    buttonText: About the rules
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: It was simple. Don't play by the Tavern's rules. If you cheat, the door
        opens.
      duration: 9.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: '"Cheating"? And you actually believed him? You think life is
      just a poker game you can rig?'
    buttonText: He's done it before
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: He'd been to the other side. He knew the path through the mist because
        he'd already walked it.
      duration: 9
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: If he's been out, why is he back? Why stay here if you have
      the keys?
    buttonText: I don't know
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: That was the part I couldn't explain. Maybe he left something behind.
      duration: 8.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Even if he knows the way, we're still sitting on the shore.
      We need a hull that floats.
    buttonText: We'll have a boat
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: I told her about the Indian crook. One last job for a way out.
      duration: 8.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Dealing with him? That's like making pact with a whale. He'll
      swallow you whole before you see the dock.
    buttonText: You're in?
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: I wasn't sure why I was offering her a seat on the ship. Maybe because
        even a suicide mission is better with a soundtrack.
      duration: 11
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: I'm in. Dying out there is better than rotting in here. We'll
      need that balcony man to guide us.
    buttonText: He's coming too
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: We couldn't do it alone. We needed the scavenger's eyes to find the route.
      duration: 8.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - npcDialogueText: Fine. Tell me when the time comes. I don't want to spend another
      lifetime not to sing here.
    buttonText: Soon
    hasMonologue: 1
    monologueLine:
      text: The pieces were moving. For the first time, this starry sky felt like
        a curtain, not a wall
      duration: 9.5
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
